\n・キラキラしたものが好き\n\nまた、このリクエストをお引き受けいただいた際は、このイラストを個人の範囲で保存するのみであり、Twitterでの米田様のツイートをリツイート以外の使用はしないものとします。\n\nもしよろしければよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ewokakunogi/status/1635243887458656256", "nc": 9, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ume_sake_takana/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2499402, "client_id": 5932, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/54067d02/uploads/origins/dcebbcbe-e89d-45f2-9999-c0f6230c257d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63861328fbc11442bb3b3d23ad549071", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/54067d02/uploads/origins/dcebbcbe-e89d-45f2-9999-c0f6230c257d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63861328fbc11442bb3b3d23ad549071, https://si.imgix.net/54067d02/uploads/origins/dcebbcbe-e89d-45f2-9999-c0f6230c257d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a25d2bcaa4576e8a8fd2cde6c3e777f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/54067d02/uploads/origins/dcebbcbe-e89d-45f2-9999-c0f6230c257d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d495fd2d21a800f60af8e9475f3c1107 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/54067d02/uploads/origins/dcebbcbe-e89d-45f2-9999-c0f6230c257d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3d5848bcd4ff9806f6666aa27fe89484", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/54067d02/uploads/origins/dcebbcbe-e89d-45f2-9999-c0f6230c257d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3d5848bcd4ff9806f6666aa27fe89484, https://si.imgix.net/54067d02/uploads/origins/dcebbcbe-e89d-45f2-9999-c0f6230c257d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ac1960261a0513551fd7bf7a8d899aaa 2